                    </div>
                    <h3 class="track-title">Cloud &amp; Security</h3>
                    <p class="track-description">
                        GCP, multi-cloud architectures, cybersecurity, DevSecOps, and robust infrastructure threat defense.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="track-tags">
                        <li>
                            <svg class="tag-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 4c-3.13 0-5.78 2.14-6.52 5.04C6.27 8.64 7.1 8.35 8 8.16 9.07 5.71 11.37 4 14 4c.69 0 1.36.12 2 .33V4h-4z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M6 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6v-4H6z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M19 14h-7v4h7c1.66 0 3-1.34 3-3s-1.34-3-3-3z"/></svg>
